title: worst-group-conformal
abstract: >-
  Code and records for a study of worst-group conformal coverage under spurious correlation:
  group-conditional calibration against group-robust training, over two benchmarks, four
  backbones, five last-layer methods, three conformity scores and a correlation-strength sweep.
